Subject: [PATCH 0010] Prism: Spaces overview + next-space commands (mac)

Adds the user-facing entry points for task spaces:
- chrome_command_ids.h: IDC_PRISM_SPACES_OVERVIEW / IDC_PRISM_CYCLE_SPACE
- browser_command_controller.cc: both commands registered in
  InitCommandState and dispatched to the PrismSpaceWindowDelegate
  (OpenSpacesOverview opens chrome://prism-spaces in a tab;
  CycleToNextSpace walks [default browsing area] + spaces by id and
  raises the matching window)
- main_menu_builder.mm: "Spaces Overview" / "Show Next Space" items in
  the View menu (hidden for PWA windows)
- accelerators_cocoa.mm: Cmd+Shift+S and Option+S key equivalents
- generated_resources.grd: the two menu titles
diff --git a/chrome/app/chrome_command_ids.h b/chrome/app/chrome_command_ids.h
index 3bdb2131ef..50625a5439 100644
--- a/chrome/app/chrome_command_ids.h
+++ b/chrome/app/chrome_command_ids.h
@@ -127,6 +127,10 @@
 #define IDC_ADD_NEW_TAB_RECENT_GROUP  34107
 #define IDC_UNFOCUS_TAB_GROUP         34108
 
+// Prism commands
+#define IDC_PRISM_SPACES_OVERVIEW       34120
+#define IDC_PRISM_CYCLE_SPACE           34121
+
 // Page-related commands
 #define IDC_BOOKMARK_THIS_TAB           35000
 #define IDC_BOOKMARK_ALL_TABS           35001
